docs {
  # DeleteKey

  `POST /v2/DeleteKey`

  Delete a key from the cluster. Its access will be removed from all the buckets. Buckets are not automatically deleted and can be dangling. You should manually delete them before.

  ## Parameters

  - `id` in query (required)
}
